   "cooked": "<p>Hello TEC! As you know, <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/Tamara\">@Tamara</a>, <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/acidlazzer\">@acidlazzer</a> and I have been working in the swag that hatchers are getting in some more weeks <img alt=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\"/><br/>\nWe wanted to get a general check on POVs from the community based in the following proposals:</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/0ebf85df1f216167674f8eb3f9d99951d25aa2c0\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/0ebf85df1f216167674f8eb3f9d99951d25aa2c0.jpeg\" title=\"MOCK_TEC_PLAYERA\"><img alt=\"MOCK_TEC_PLAYERA\" data-base62-sha1=\"26t1h7HtdOTHVs7I7xu7jOrta7u\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0ebf85df1f216167674f8eb3f9d99951d25aa2c0_2_10x10.png\" height=\"388\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0ebf85df1f216167674f8eb3f9d99951d25aa2c0_2_690x388.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0ebf85df1f216167674f8eb3f9d99951d25aa2c0_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0ebf85df1f216167674f8eb3f9d99951d25aa2c0_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0ebf85df1f216167674f8eb3f9d99951d25aa2c0_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" width=\"690\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">MOCK_TEC_PLAYERA</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 279 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br/>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/1093cf271e13fae07c2a2d540d444aac9026dd42\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/1093cf271e13fae07c2a2d540d444aac9026dd42.jpeg\" title=\"MOCK_TEC_PLAYERA_2\"><img alt=\"MOCK_TEC_PLAYERA_2\" data-base62-sha1=\"2mEjNe1IF2O7o0reaMjk5PWIUpQ\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/1093cf271e13fae07c2a2d540d444aac9026dd42_2_10x10.png\" height=\"388\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/1093cf271e13fae07c2a2d540d444aac9026dd42_2_690x388.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/1093cf271e13fae07c2a2d540d444aac9026dd42_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/1093cf271e13fae07c2a2d540d444aac9026dd42_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/1093cf271e13fae07c2a2d540d444aac9026dd42_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" width=\"690\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">MOCK_TEC_PLAYERA_2</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 276 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><p></p>\n<p>We’d like to make clear that <strong>none of these are final designs</strong>, just some tests for look &amp; feel. If you can help us submitting your vote it would be of great help to make newer proposals based in the direction the community is more appealed to. Everyone has 2 votes.</p>\n<p>Let us know if you have any comments <img alt=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/blush.png?v=9\" title=\":blush:\"/></p>\n<div class=\"poll\" data-poll-charttype=\"bar\" data-poll-max=\"2\" data-poll-min=\"1\" data-poll-name=\"poll\" data-poll-results=\"always\" data-poll-status=\"open\" data-poll-type=\"multiple\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"poll-container\">\n<ul>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"26dc7e6b4cb72412b4e7c4ce52f93999\">Design <span class=\"hashtag\">#1</span>\n</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"3d8ac5ce08bb9b0bf5e5ba9bb81117ff\">Design <span class=\"hashtag\">#2</span>\n</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"aa4b546a85420501483d2cfce2b612f9\">Design <span class=\"hashtag\">#3</span>\n</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"7c7212a0fda430e4be582c409341472a\">Design <span class=\"hashtag\">#4</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"poll-info\">\n<p>\n<span class=\"info-number\">0</span>\n<span class=\"info-label\">voters</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
